=x - 8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int e^{y}\\,\\mathrm{d}y & =\\int x - 8\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\ e^{y} & =\\frac{\\left(x - 8\\right)^{2}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution in implicit form is\n\n$$\ne^{y}=\\frac{\\left(x - 8\\right)^{2}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ Solving for $y$ gives\n\n$$\ny=\\ln{\\left(C + \\frac{\\left(x - 8\\right)^{2}}{2} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant."] [:db/add "4e2e674b-0850-5368-88f6-14e03d6bfda5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "4e2e674b-0850-5368-88f6-14e03d6bfda5" :question/answer-fields "263632f2-df73-5f67-9e44-f172ab629be2"] [:db/ensure "4e2e674b-0850-5368-88f6-14e03d6bfda5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068840 :knowledge-point/questions "4e2e674b-0850-5368-88f6-14e03d6bfda5"] [:db/add "6c337c3f-e451-5f2b-8028-cc25f22de1ac" :answer/id #uuid "6c337c3f-e451-5f2b-8028-cc25f22de1ac"] [:db/add "6c337c3f-e451-5f2b-8028-cc25f22de1ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6c337c3f-e451-5f2b-8028-cc25f22de1ac" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[3]{C - \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "6c337c3f-e451-5f2b-8028-cc25f22de1ac" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fbc6ce09-69ed-5a62-9eb1-12cde5e864b8" :answer/id #uuid "fbc6ce09-69ed-5a62-9eb1-12cde5e864b8"] [:db/add "fbc6ce09-69ed-5a62-9eb1-12cde5e864b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fbc6ce09-69ed-5a62-9eb1-12cde5e864b8" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[3]{C + 2 \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "fbc6ce09-69ed-5a62-9eb1-12cde5e864b8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c676eb7d-d036-56b0-9476-a8bc8f71b959" :answer/id #uuid "c676eb7d-d036-56b0-9476-a8bc8f71b959"] [:db/add "c676eb7d-d036-56b0-9476-a8bc8f71b959" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c676eb7d-d036-56b0-9476-a8bc8f71b959" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[3]{C - 2 \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "c676eb7d-d036-56b0-9476-a8bc8f71b959" :answer/validate] [:db/add "40de40ea-de47-5945-83e5-48552756376d" :answer/id #uuid "40de40ea-de47-5945-83e5-48552756376d"] [:db/add "40de40ea-de47-5945-83e5-48552756376d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "40de40ea-de47-5945-83e5-48552756376d" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[3]{C + 3 \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "40de40ea-de47-5945-83e5-48552756376d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7c3af1fe-7854-5d59-8d54-20802f3b93c4" :answer/id #uuid "7c3af1fe-7854-5d59-8d54-20802f3b93c4"] [:db/add "7c3af1fe-7854-5d59-8d54-20802f3b93c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7c3af1fe-7854-5d59-8d54-20802f3b93c4" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[3]{C + \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "7c3af1fe-7854-5d59-8d54-20802f3b93c4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/id #uuid "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea"] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/choices "6c337c3f-e451-5f2b-8028-cc25f22de1ac"] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/choices "fbc6ce09-69ed-5a62-9eb1-12cde5e864b8"] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/choices "c676eb7d-d036-56b0-9476-a8bc8f71b959"] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/choices "40de40ea-de47-5945-83e5-48552756376d"] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/choices "7c3af1fe-7854-5d59-8d54-20802f3b93c4"] [:db/add "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/correct "c676eb7d-d036-56b0-9476-a8bc8f71b959"] [:db/ensure "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237" :question/id #uuid "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237"] [:db/add "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $y′=\\frac{- 4 x - 16}{3 y^{2}}.$ Work on intervals where $y\\ne 0$; cube roots are real."] [:db/add "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y′ & =\\frac{- 4 x - 16}{3 y^{2}} \\\\ 3 y^{2}\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} & =- 4 x - 16\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 3 y^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}y & =\\int - 4 x - 16\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\ y^{3} & =- 2 \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution in implicit form is\n\n$$\ny^{3}=- 2 \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ Solving for $y$ gives\n\n$$\ny=\\sqrt[3]{C - 2 \\left(x + 4\\right)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant."] [:db/add "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237" :question/answer-fields "1cb0fb69-bacc-5d3c-a375-f02460cca2ea"] [:db/ensure "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068840 :knowledge-point/questions "56a509c2-c05b-5e8a-a692-10fa903b3237"] [:db/add "de910995-243e-53a6-b31f-d50546e6b6dd" :answer/id #uuid "de910995-243e-53a6-b31f-d50546e6b6dd"] [:db/add "de910995-243e-53a6-b31f-d50546e6b6dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "de910995-243e-53a6-b31f-d50546e6b6dd" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[3]{C + 3 \\left(x - 2\\right)^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "de910995-243e-53a6-b31f-d50546e6b6dd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9a2f0086-02ae-5d62-b506-2977900faf52" :answer/id #uuid "9a2f0086-02ae-5d62-b506-2977900faf52"] [:db/add "9a2f0086-02ae-5d62-b506-2977900faf52" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9a2f0086-02ae-5d62-b506-2977900faf52" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[3]{C + \\left(x - 2\\right)^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "9a2f0086-02ae-5d62-b506-2977900faf52" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8563ce9a-2222-580d-a85a-03e7321d082a" :answer/id #uuid "8563c